# Walkthrough - Project Board Integration

I have successfully integrated the frontend project board with the backend API, enabling real data management for projects, tasks, and subtasks. I also fixed several type errors and verified the application runs correctly in Docker.

## Changes

### Frontend Integration
- **Project Board:** [ProjectBoardPage](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/pages/ProjectBoardPage.tsx#10-83) now fetches projects and tasks from the backend.
- **Task Creation:** Implemented [CreateTaskModal](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/CreateTaskModal.tsx#22-106) to add new tasks.
- **Subtask Management:** Updated [TaskDetailModal](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/TaskDetailModal.tsx#39-277) to support creating, viewing, toggling, and deleting subtasks.
- **Data Refresh:** Added a `refreshTrigger` to the [KanbanBoard](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/kanban/KanbanBoard.tsx#29-194) to ensure the UI updates after task creation.
- **Authentication:** [AuthContext](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/context/AuthContext.tsx#4-12) now fetches and uses the real user profile.

### Type & Schema Fixes
- **Interfaces:** Updated [Task](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/schemas/task.py#24-32) and [Subtask](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/services/subtasks.ts#3-12) interfaces in [types/task.ts](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/types/task.ts) and [services/subtasks.ts](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/services/subtasks.ts) to (mostly) match backend schemas (e.g., optional `created_at`, `updated_at`).
- **Dashboard:** Fixed type errors in `DashboardPage.tsx` regarding [PulseCard](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/dashboard/PulseCard.tsx#15-79) props.
- **Project Detail:** Fixed `ProjectDetailPage.tsx` to use [getTasks](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/services/tasks.ts#7-16) properly.

### Verification
- **Build:** Verified `npm run build` passes without errors.
- **Docker:**
    - Cleaned up old containers.
    - Built and started services using `docker-compose up --build`.
    - Services [backend](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/Dockerfile.backend), `db`, and `nginx` are healthy and running.
- **Browser Check:** Verified login flow and navigation to projects page using a browser agent.

## How to Verify
1. **Access the App:** Open `http://localhost` in your browser.
2. **Login/Register:** Create a new account or login.
3. **Create Project:** Go to Projects -> New Project.
4. **Manage Tasks:** Open the project board, create tasks, and manage subtasks within them.

